// Ports `gate_staleness` (bootstrap/cw-vsa/src/checks.rs): every path the
// Causeway rule set refers to must still exist, or a regex scoped to a missing
// path passes vacuously. The list is .mise/rhai/vsa/required_paths.rhai as of
// Causeway 40f993d7; it is Causeway's data, copied here so the rule stands alone.
//
// Graph facts: a File node per indexed file (`file:<path>`), and the file paths
// of the nodes under a directory. A directory exists when any File node lies
// under it.
//
// Gap: Surveyor's walker skips dot-directories, so the nine paths under .mise/
// and .github/ have no File nodes and cannot be checked here; they are skipped
// by prefix rather than reported as missing. cw-vsa checks them on disk.
